---
import { getLocalizedPath } from '../../lib/i18n';
import type { Locale } from '../../lib/i18n';

interface Props {
  locale?: Locale;
}
const { locale = 'en' } = Astro.props;

const t: Record<string, { label: string; number: string; body: string; exact: string; link: string }> = {
  en: {
    label: 'EPISTEMIC FIXED POINT',
    number: '100',
    body: 'The language turned its uncertainty system on itself. Across eight bootstrap generations, the compiler tracked its own confidence through every expression. At generation eight: 113,931 expressions. All certain. Guard overhead: zero bytes. The binary proved it by compiling itself twice to the same hash.',
    exact: 'md5(gen₂.elf) = md5(gen₃.elf) · 15,636 call sites · 0 guarded · 1.25 MB',
    link: 'See the bootstrap convergence proof →',
  },
  pt: {
    label: 'PONTO FIXO EPISTÉMICO',
    number: '100',
    body: 'A linguagem virou o seu sistema de incerteza sobre si própria. Ao longo de oito gerações de bootstrap, o compilador rastreou a sua própria confiança em cada expressão. Na geração oito: 113.931 expressões. Todas certas. Overhead de guarda: zero bytes. O binário provou-o compilando-se a si próprio duas vezes com o mesmo hash.',
    exact: 'md5(gen₂.elf) = md5(gen₃.elf) · 15.636 call sites · 0 guardados · 1,25 MB',
    link: 'Ver a prova de convergência do bootstrap →',
  },
  es: {
    label: 'PUNTO FIJO EPISTÉMICO',
    number: '100',
    body: 'El lenguaje volvió su sistema de incertidumbre sobre sí mismo. A lo largo de ocho generaciones de bootstrap, el compilador rastreó su propia confianza en cada expresión. En la generación ocho: 113.931 expresiones. Todas ciertas. Coste de guarda: cero bytes. El binario lo demostró compilándose a sí mismo dos veces con el mismo hash.',
    exact: 'md5(gen₂.elf) = md5(gen₃.elf) · 15.636 call sites · 0 guardados · 1,25 MB',
    link: 'Ver la prueba de convergencia del bootstrap →',
  },
  el: {
    label: 'ΕΠΙΣΤΗΜΙΚΟ ΣΤΑΘΕΡΟ ΣΗΜΕΙΟ',
    number: '100',
    body: 'Η γλώσσα στρεψε το σύστημά της αβεβαιότητας πάνω στον εαυτό της. Σε οκτώ γενιές bootstrap, ο compiler παρακολούθησε τη δική του εμπιστοσύνη σε κάθε έκφραση. Στην γενιά οκτώ: 113.931 εκφράσεις. Όλες βέβαιες. Κόστος φύλαξης: μηδέν bytes. Το δυαδικό το απέδειξε μεταγλωττίζοντας τον εαυτό του δύο φορές στο ίδιο hash.',
    exact: 'md5(gen₂.elf) = md5(gen₃.elf) · 15.636 call sites · 0 φυλαγμένα · 1,25 MB',
    link: 'Δείτε την απόδειξη σύγκλισης bootstrap →',
  },
  zh: {
    label: '知识论不动点',
    number: '100',
    body: '这门语言将其不确定性系统对准了自身。在八代自举过程中，编译器追踪了每个表达式的自身置信度。第八代：113,931 个表达式，全部确定。防护开销：零字节。二进制文件通过两次编译出相同哈希值证明了这一点。',
    exact: 'md5(gen₂.elf) = md5(gen₃.elf) · 15,636 个调用点 · 0 个受防护 · 1.25 MB',
    link: '查看自举收敛证明 →',
  },
  ja: {
    label: '認識論的不動点',
    number: '100',
    body: 'この言語は不確実性システムを自分自身に向けました。8世代のブートストラップを通じて、コンパイラはすべての式で自身の確信度を追跡しました。第8世代：113,931の式、すべて確実。ガードのオーバーヘッド：ゼロバイト。バイナリは自身を2回コンパイルして同じハッシュを得ることで証明しました。',
    exact: 'md5(gen₂.elf) = md5(gen₃.elf) · 15,636 コールサイト · 0 ガード · 1.25 MB',
    link: 'ブートストラップ収束証明を見る →',
  },
};

const d = t[locale] ?? t.en;
---

<section class="na-section" aria-label="Epistemic fixed point">
  <div class="na-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="na-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="na-inner">
    <div class="na-number" aria-hidden="true">{d.number}<span class="na-pct">%</span></div>
    <div class="na-text">
      <p class="na-label">{d.label}</p>
      <p class="na-body">{d.body}</p>
      <p class="na-exact"><code>{d.exact}</code></p>
      <a href={getLocalizedPath('/compiler#bootstrap-convergence', locale)} class="na-link">
        {d.link}
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .na-section {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 5.5rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--glass-border);
  }

  .na-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -10% 0;
    background-image: url('/assets/vision/act1-column.jpg');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center 35%;
    opacity: 0.18;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .na-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      var(--color-bg) 0%,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 55%, transparent) 20%,
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg) 45%, transparent) 80%,
      var(--color-bg) 100%
    );
  }

  .na-inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .na-inner {
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: 3.5rem;
    }
  }

  .na-number {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(5.5rem, 16vw, 10rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 0.88;
    background: linear-gradient(
      145deg,
      var(--color-accent-gold) 0%,
      var(--color-accent-gold-soft) 55%,
      rgba(214,179,90,0.45) 100%
    );
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .na-pct {
    font-size: 0.45em;
    vertical-align: super;
    letter-spacing: 0;
  }

  .na-text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.85rem;
  }

  .na-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    color: var(--color-accent-gold-soft);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.75;
  }

  .na-body {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 50ch;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
  }

  .na-exact {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .na-exact code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .na-link {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-accent-gold-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.3rem;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }

  .na-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.75;
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>

<script>
  import gsap from 'gsap';
  import { ScrollTrigger } from 'gsap/ScrollTrigger';
  gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);

  const mm = gsap.matchMedia();
  mm.add('(prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)', () => {
    const section = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.na-section');
    const bg = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.na-bg');
    const numberEl = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.na-number');
    const pctEl = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.na-pct');
    const textChildren = document.querySelectorAll('.na-text > *');

    if (!section || !bg || !numberEl || !pctEl) return;

    // background parallax
    gsap.to(bg, {
      yPercent: 15,
      ease: 'none',
      scrollTrigger: {
        trigger: section,
        start: 'top bottom',
        end: 'bottom top',
        scrub: 1.5,
      },
    });

    // count-up 0 → 100, % sign fades in at the end
    gsap.set(pctEl, { opacity: 0 });
    const obj = { val: 0 };
    gsap.to(obj, {
      val: 100,
      duration: 1.8,
      ease: 'power3.out',
      scrollTrigger: {
        trigger: numberEl,
        start: 'top 85%',
        once: true,
      },
      onUpdate() {
        const v = Math.round(obj.val);
        numberEl.firstChild!.textContent = String(v);
      },
      onComplete() {
        gsap.to(pctEl, { opacity: 1, duration: 0.4, ease: 'power1.out' });
      },
    });

    // text cascade
    gsap.from(Array.from(textChildren), {
      y: 28,
      opacity: 0,
      stagger: 0.12,
      duration: 0.75,
      ease: 'power2.out',
      scrollTrigger: {
        trigger: section,
        start: 'top 72%',
        once: true,
      },
    });
  });
</script>
